<div class="wide"><span class="lf-t">Housing mix</span>Janesville has historic homes on Courthouse Hill, many mid-century homes built during its manufacturing years and newer subdivisions on the east and north sides.</div>
<div class="wide"><span class="lf-t">Local claim risks</span><ul class="chips navy" style="margin:6px 0 0"><li>River flooding</li><li>Tornadoes</li><li>Hail</li><li>Basement water</li><li>Frozen pipes</li></ul></div>
